OL,3,GNEWSADoctor's ban extended over theft
OL,4,Afrom patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Wolverhampton hospital doctor who was
OL,7,Fsuspended last year has been ordered
OL,8,Fnot to practise for another 12 months
OL,9,Fafter a tribunal found she continued to
OL,10,Fpose a high risk to the public.
OL,12,FDr Sandra Chika Ndirika, who was a
OL,13,Furology trainee at New Cross Hospital,
OL,14,Fwas previously suspended after being
OL,15,Fconvicted of stealing from a vulnerable
OL,16,Fpatient and a colleague.
OL,18,FThe Medical Practitioners Tribunal
OL,19,FService's latest decision found her
OL,20,Ffitness to practise remained impaired.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
